---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy — Mithra" description="Understand how Mithra Technologies uses cookies and similar tracking technologies.">
  <Navigation />

  <!-- Dark header -->
  <section class="pt-24 pb-12 bg-ibm-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-8xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8">
      <p class="text-ibm-blue text-sm font-medium tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-light text-white mb-3">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-ibm-gray-40 text-sm">Last updated: May 27, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-8xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">

        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          This Cookie Policy explains how Mithra Technologies S.A. de C.V. ("Mithra," "we," "us," or "our") uses cookies and similar technologies when you visit our website or use our platform. It should be read alongside our <a href="/privacy" class="text-ibm-blue hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Cookies are small text files placed on your device by a website when you visit it. They are widely used to make websites work efficiently, to remember your preferences, and to provide information to site owners. Cookies can be "session cookies" (deleted when you close your browser) or "persistent cookies" (which remain on your device for a set period or until you delete them).
        </p>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We also use similar technologies such as local storage and pixel tags, which function in a comparable way. In this policy, we use the term "cookies" to refer to all such technologies collectively.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">2. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>

        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Essential Cookies.</strong> These cookies are strictly necessary for our website and platform to function. They enable core features such as user authentication, session management, and security protections (e.g., CSRF tokens). You cannot opt out of essential cookies without disabling your ability to use the Services.</p>

        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Analytics Cookies.</strong> We use first-party analytics cookies to understand how visitors navigate our website and how customers use the platform. This helps us identify what is working well and what needs improvement. All analytics data is processed on our own infrastructure — we do not send raw analytics data to third-party analytics platforms. Data collected is aggregated and does not identify individual users in reports.</p>

        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Preference Cookies.</strong> These cookies remember choices you make — such as language preference, dashboard layout, or display settings — so that you do not need to reconfigure them on each visit. Disabling these cookies may result in a less personalized experience.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">3. What We Do Not Use</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We do not use <strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">third-party advertising or tracking cookies</strong>. We do not participate in cross-site behavioral advertising networks, retargeting programs, or data broker relationships. Our cookie usage is limited to the operational and analytics purposes described above.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">4. Cookie List</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">The table below describes the specific cookies currently set by Mithra:</p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="text-left py-2 px-3 bg-ibm-gray-10 font-medium text-ibm-gray-100 border border-ibm-gray-20">Name</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 px-3 bg-ibm-gray-10 font-medium text-ibm-gray-100 border border-ibm-gray-20">Category</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 px-3 bg-ibm-gray-10 font-medium text-ibm-gray-100 border border-ibm-gray-20">Purpose</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 px-3 bg-ibm-gray-10 font-medium text-ibm-gray-100 border border-ibm-gray-20">Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70"><code>mth_session</code></td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Essential</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Maintains your authenticated session across page loads.</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Session</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70"><code>mth_csrf</code></td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Essential</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Cross-site request forgery protection token.</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Session</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70"><code>mth_auth_token</code></td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Essential</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Persistent authentication token for "Remember me" functionality.</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">30 days</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70"><code>mth_analytics_id</code></td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Analytics</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Pseudonymous identifier used to measure feature usage and navigation paths.</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">12 months</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70"><code>mth_page_view</code></td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Analytics</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Tracks page view counts and session duration for product analytics.</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Session</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70"><code>mth_lang</code></td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Preference</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Stores your preferred display language.</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">12 months</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70"><code>mth_theme</code></td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Preference</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Remembers your light/dark mode or dashboard color theme choice.</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">12 months</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70"><code>mth_cookie_consent</code></td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Essential</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">Records your cookie consent choices so we do not ask repeatedly.</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 border border-ibm-gray-20 text-ibm-gray-70">12 months</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">5. How to Control Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          You have several options to control or limit how cookies are used:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ibm-gray-70 mb-4">
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Browser settings:</strong> Most browsers allow you to view, manage, block, and delete cookies. To do this, visit your browser's help section or settings. Note that blocking essential cookies will prevent you from logging into the platform.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Analytics opt-out:</strong> To opt out of first-party analytics cookies, you may update your preferences in your Account Settings page under Privacy Controls. Alternatively, use your browser's "Do Not Track" signal — we honor this signal for analytics cookies.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Cookie consent banner:</strong> When you first visit our website, a consent banner allows you to accept or decline non-essential cookies. You can change your choices at any time by clicking "Cookie Preferences" in the website footer.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For more information about managing cookies across different browsers, visit <a href="https://www.allaboutcookies.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ibm-blue hover:underline">allaboutcookies.org</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We may update this Cookie Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices or applicable regulations. When we do, we will revise the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this policy occasionally.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Questions about our use of cookies? Reach out:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ibm-gray-70 mb-4">
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@mithra.ai" class="text-ibm-blue hover:underline">privacy@mithra.ai</a></li>
          <li>Mail: Mithra Technologies S.A. de C.V., Paseo de la Reforma 250, Mexico City, Mexico</li>
        </ul>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
